# Resi, the hero (Zuckerschock form, after a Mozartkugel). Dirndl: red bodice and skirt (r R), sky-blue
# apron (S b), white blouse (w i), blond braid (Y o O). Art faces right;
# mirror = auto makes the left-facing copy. Hitbox 12x30, feet at the bottom.
# Built from layered parts by the pixel-artist; the grids below are the source.
sprite = player_big
size   = 16x32
origin = 8,32
hitbox = 2,2,12,30
mirror = auto
anim   = idle frames=2 ticks=30 loop
anim   = walk frames=4 ticks=8 loop
anim   = run  frames=4 ticks=5 loop
anim   = skid frames=1
anim   = jump frames=1
anim   = fall frames=1
anim   = die  frames=1
anim   = pole frames=2 ticks=8 loop
